-04_15_49-pm-png','','','2026-09-19 09:24:33','2026-09-19 09:24:33','',93,'http://the-fashion-frame.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ChatGPT-Image-Sep-15-2026-04_15_49-PM.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(198,1,'2026-09-19 09:24:37','2026-09-19 09:24:37','','ChatGPT-Image-Sep-15-2026-04_15_54-PM.png','','inherit','open','closed','','chatgpt-image-sep-15-2026-04_15_54-pm-png','','','2026-09-19 09:24:37','2026-09-19 09:24:37','',93,'http://the-fashion-frame.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ChatGPT-Image-Sep-15-2026-04_15_54-PM.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(199,0,'2026-09-22 00:38:52','2026-09-22 00:38:52','<div class=\"policy-page-wrap\">\n  <!-- Top Intro & Quick Anchors -->\n  <div class=\"policy-hero-card\">\n    <div class=\"policy-badge\">\n      <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">local_shipping</span>\n      <span>Complimentary Pan-India Shipping on orders above ₹1,999</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"policy-lead\">\n      At The Fashion Frame, every piece of readymade couture is treated with meticulous care—from precision steam finishing to luxury tamper-proof packaging. Whether you require doorstep delivery across India or in-store boutique pickup in Lucknow, our shipping and return policies are designed for total peace of mind.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"policy-quick-links\">\n      <a href=\"#shipping\" class=\"policy-pill-btn\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">package_2</span> Shipping &amp; Delivery</a>\n      <a href=\"#returns\" class=\"policy-pill-btn\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">sync_alt</span> Returns &amp; Exchanges</a>\n      <a href=\"https://wa.me/919278340090\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"policy-pill-btn policy-pill-wa\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">chat</span> WhatsApp Support</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- SECTION 1: SHIPPING & DELIVERY -->\n  <section id=\"shipping\" class=\"policy-section\">\n    <div class=\"policy-section-header\">\n      <span class=\"policy-section-tag\">Logistics &amp; Transit</span>\n      <h2 class=\"policy-section-title\">Shipping &amp; Pan-India Delivery</h2>\n      <div class=\"gold-hairline-sm\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Highlights Grid -->\n    <div class=\"policy-grid-3\">\n      <div class=\"policy-feature-card\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon-circle\">\n          <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">schedule</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"feature-title\">Standard Delivery</h3>\n        <p class=\"feature-subtitle\">3 to 5 Business Days</p>\n        <p class=\"feature-desc\">Reliable air and express road delivery across all 19,000+ pin codes in India via BlueDart, Delhivery, and DTDC.</p>\n        <span class=\"feature-price-badge feature-price-free\">Free over ₹1,999 (₹150 flat below)</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"policy-feature-card\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon-circle\">\n          <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">bolt</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"feature-title\">Express Dispatch</h3>\n        <p class=\"feature-subtitle\">1 to 2 Business Days</p>\n        <p class=\"feature-desc\">Priority air courier dispatch available for major metro cities (Delhi NCR, Mumbai, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Kolkata).</p>\n        <span class=\"feature-price-badge\">₹350 Flat Express Fee</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"policy-feature-card\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon-circle\">\n          <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">storefront</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"feature-title\">Lucknow Store Pickup</h3>\n        <p class=\"feature-subtitle\">Same-Day Ready</p>\n        <p class=\"feature-desc\">Collect your readymade ensemble directly at our Hazratganj or Gomti Nagar boutique within 4 hours of ordering.</p>\n        <span class=\"feature-price-badge feature-price-free\">Free for all orders</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Details Breakdown -->\n    <div class=\"policy-detail-card\">\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">Order Processing &amp; Live Tracking</h3>\n      <p>Orders are dispatched within 24–48 hours of order confirmation (Monday through Saturday, excluding gazetted national holidays). As soon as your order leaves our Lucknow fulfilment boutique, you will receive an automatic dispatch notification via <strong>WhatsApp &amp; SMS</strong> containing your live tracking number and courier tracking link.</p>\n      \n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">Artisanal Tamper-Proof Packaging</h3>\n      <p>Each readymade suit, sherwani, or kid\'s ensemble is enveloped in breathable, moisture-resistant boutique garment covers and shipped in reinforced, luxury hard-shell boxes to ensure garments arrive uncreased and immaculate.</p>\n      \n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">Non-Serviceable Locations &amp; Remote Addresses</h3>\n      <p>In rare instances where a private express courier cannot service your postal code, we route shipments via India Post Speed Post. Delivery timelines for remote or restricted zones may require an additional 2–3 business days.</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- SECTION 2: RETURNS & EXCHANGES -->\n  <section id=\"returns\" class=\"policy-section\">\n    <div class=\"policy-section-header\">\n      <span class=\"policy-section-tag\">Hassle-Free Guarantee</span>\n      <h2 class=\"policy-section-title\">Returns &amp; Size Exchanges</h2>\n      <div class=\"gold-hairline-sm\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Highlights Grid -->\n    <div class=\"policy-grid-3\">\n      <div class=\"policy-feature-card\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon-circle\">\n          <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">event_repeat</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"feature-title\">7-Day Return Window</h3>\n        <p class=\"feature-subtitle\">From Date of Delivery</p>\n        <p class=\"feature-desc\">Request an exchange or return within 7 calendar days of receiving your package—no complicated paperwork required.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"policy-feature-card\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon-circle\">\n          <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">local_shipping</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"feature-title\">Doorstep Reverse Pickup</h3>\n        <p class=\"feature-subtitle\">Pan-India Courier Service</p>\n        <p class=\"feature-desc\">Our courier partner will collect the securely packed parcel directly from your address at a time convenient to you.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"policy-feature-card\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon-circle\">\n          <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">currency_rupee</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"feature-title\">Store Credit or Refund</h3>\n        <p class=\"feature-subtitle\">Processed in 24-48 Hours</p>\n        <p class=\"feature-desc\">Choose between a seamless size replacement, an instant digital store credit voucher (valid for 1 year), or a refund to your source payment account.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Step by Step Return Process -->\n    <div class=\"policy-detail-card\">\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">How to Initiate a Return or Exchange (4 Simple Steps)</h3>\n      <div class=\"steps-flow-grid\">\n        <div class=\"step-box\">\n          <div class=\"step-num\">01</div>\n          <h4 class=\"step-title\">Submit Request</h4>\n          <p class=\"step-desc\">WhatsApp our Care team at <strong>+91 92783 40090</strong> or email <strong>care@thefashionframe.com</strong> with your Order ID and preferred size or reason.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step-box\">\n          <div class=\"step-num\">02</div>\n          <h4 class=\"step-title\">Repack With Care</h4>\n          <p class=\"step-desc\">Ensure the garment is unworn, unwashed, and placed back in its original packaging with all boutique tags and invoices intact.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step-box\">\n          <div class=\"step-num\">03</div>\n          <h4 class=\"step-title\">Doorstep Pickup</h4>\n          <p class=\"step-desc\">Our courier partner will collect the parcel within 24–48 hours. A physical or digital receipt will be provided upon pickup.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step-box\">\n          <div class=\"step-num\">04</div>\n          <h4 class=\"step-title\">Resolution &amp; Exchange</h4>\n          <p class=\"step-desc\">Once received and inspected at our Lucknow boutique, your replacement size is dispatched immediately or refund processed within 48 hours.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">Conditions &amp; Non-Returnable Items</h3>\n      <p>To uphold the highest hygiene and quality standards for all patrons, the following conditions apply:</p>\n      <ul class=\"policy-list\">\n        <li>Garments must be intact with all original brand tags, security ribbons, and packaging intact.</li>\n        <li>Items that exhibit signs of wear, makeup stains, perfume odors, or laundering cannot be accepted.</li>\n        <li>Customized or tailor-altered garments (e.g., customized sleeve lengths or pant hems) are customized specifically for you and are final sale.</li>\n        <li>Boutique Archive Sale / Final Clearance items marked as non-returnable are eligible for size exchange only (subject to availability).</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <div class=\"boutique-alteration-callout\">\n        <div class=\"callout-icon\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">design_services</span></div>\n        <div class=\"callout-content\">\n          <h4>In Lucknow? Enjoy Complimentary Boutique Fitting &amp; Alterations</h4>\n          <p>If you\'re in Lucknow, you never have to return a suit just for a small fit adjustment. Bring your garment to our flagship showroom in Hazratganj or Gomti Nagar—our master tailors will fit and alter it for you with our compliments.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Support Banner -->\n  <div class=\"policy-support-banner\">\n    <div class=\"support-text\">\n      <h3>Have Questions About Your Order or Delivery?</h3>\n      <p>Our dedicated Lucknow concierge is available 7 days a week, 10:00 AM – 8:00 PM IST.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"support-actions\">\n      <a href=\"https://wa.me/919278340090\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"support-btn support-btn-gold\">\n        <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">chat</span> Chat on WhatsApp\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"tel:+919278340090\" class=\"support-btn support-btn-outline\">\n        <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">call</span> Call +91 92783 40090\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n','Shipping & Returns','','publish','closed','closed','','shipping-returns','','','2026-09-22 00:38:52','2026-09-22 00:38:52','',0,'http://the-fashion-frame.local/shipping-returns/',0,'page','',0),(200,0,'2026-09-22 00:38:52','2026-09-22 00:38:52','<div class=\"policy-page-wrap\">\n  <!-- Hero / Intro -->\n  <div class=\"policy-hero-card\">\n    <div class=\"policy-badge\">\n      <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">straighten</span>\n      <span>Precision Sizing &amp; Fit Architecture</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"policy-lead\">\n      The Fashion Frame\'s readymade silhouettes are patterned specifically for Indian body shapes, balancing tailored grace with effortless comfort. Use our comprehensive charts and measuring guide below to discover your perfect fit across Women\'s Suits, Men\'s Ethnic &amp; Formal Wear, and Kids\' Ensembles.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"policy-quick-links\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"policy-pill-btn size-tab-trigger is-active\" data-target=\"tab-women\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">woman</span> Women\'s Suits &amp; Sets</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"policy-pill-btn size-tab-trigger\" data-target=\"tab-men\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">man</span> Men\'s Wear &amp; Ethnic</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"policy-pill-btn size-tab-trigger\" data-target=\"tab-kids\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">child_care</span> Kids\' Ensembles</button>\n      <a href=\"#how-to-measure\" class=\"policy-pill-btn\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">help</span> How to Measure</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- TAB 1: WOMEN\'S SIZING -->\n  <section id=\"tab-women\" class=\"size-guide-tab-pane is-active policy-section\">\n    <div class=\"policy-section-header\">\n      <span class=\"policy-section-tag\">Women\'s Collection</span>\n      <h2 class=\"policy-section-title\">Women\'s Suits, Kurtas &amp; Sets</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-subtitle\">All measurements below are garment measurements in <strong>Inches</strong> (with metric centimeters indicated). Our readymade kurtas are drafted with standard ease of 3–4 inches over body measurements for supreme comfort.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"policy-table-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"luxury-size-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Size</th>\n            <th>Standard (India)</th>\n            <th>Bust (in / cm)</th>\n            <th>Waist (in / cm)</th>\n            <th>Hip (in / cm)</th>\n            <th>Shoulder (in)</th>\n            <th>Kurta Length (in)</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">XS</strong></td>\n            <td>34</td>\n            <td>34\" / 86 cm</td>\n            <td>30\" / 76 cm</td>\n            <td>38\" / 96 cm</td>\n            <td>13.5\"</td>\n            <td>44\" - 46\"</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">S</strong></td>\n            <td>36</td>\n            <td>36\" / 91 cm</td>\n            <td>32\" / 81 cm</td>\n            <td>40\" / 101 cm</td>\n            <td>14.0\"</td>\n            <td>44\" - 46\"</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">M</strong></td>\n            <td>38</td>\n            <td>38\" / 96 cm</td>\n            <td>34\" / 86 cm</td>\n            <td>42\" / 106 cm</td>\n            <td>14.5\"</td>\n            <td>45\" - 47\"</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">L</strong></td>\n            <td>40</td>\n            <td>40\" / 101 cm</td>\n            <td>36\" / 91 cm</td>\n            <td>44\" / 111 cm</td>\n            <td>15.0\"</td>\n            <td>45\" - 47\"</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">XL</strong></td>\n            <td>42</td>\n            <td>42\" / 106 cm</td>\n            <td>38\" / 96 cm</td>\n            <td>46\" / 116 cm</td>\n            <td>15.5\"</td>\n            <td>46\" - 48\"</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">2XL</strong></td>\n            <td>44</td>\n            <td>44\" / 111 cm</td>\n            <td>40\" / 101 cm</td>\n            <td>48\" / 121 cm</td>\n            <td>16.0\"</td>\n            <td>46\" - 48\"</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">3XL</strong></td>\n            <td>46</td>\n            <td>46\" / 116 cm</td>\n            <td>42\" / 106 cm</td>\n            <td>50\" / 127 cm</td>\n            <td>16.5\"</td>\n            <td>46\" - 48\"</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"table-note\">* Note: Straight cut suits feature standard hip room. Anarkalis and flared kalidar kurtas have relaxed, fluid flare around the hips.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- TAB 2: MEN\'S SIZING -->\n  <section id=\"tab-men\" class=\"size-guide-tab-pane policy-section\">\n    <div class=\"policy-section-header\">\n      <span class=\"policy-section-tag\">Men\'s Collection</span>\n      <h2 class=\"policy-section-title\">Men\'s Ethnic Kurtas, Shirts &amp; Bandhgalas</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-subtitle\">Measurements represent garment circumference in inches. For a tailored contemporary look, choose your regular chest size. For a traditional relaxed drape, order one size up.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"policy-table-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"luxury-size-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Size Label</th>\n            <th>Chest (in / cm)</th>\n            <th>Waist (in / cm)</th>\n            <th>Across Shoulder (in)</th>\n            <th>Sleeve Length (in)</th>\n            <th>Kurta Length (in)</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">38 (S)</strong></td>\n            <td>40\" / 101 cm</td>\n            <td>37\" / 94 cm</td>\n            <td>17.5\"</td>\n            <td>24.5\"</td>\n            <td>40\"</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">40 (M)</strong></td>\n            <td>42\" / 106 cm</td>\n            <td>39\" / 99 cm</td>\n            <td>18.0\"</td>\n            <td>25.0\"</td>\n            <td>41\"</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">42 (L)</strong></td>\n            <td>44\" / 111 cm</td>\n            <td>41\" / 104 cm</td>\n            <td>18.5\"</td>\n            <td>25.5\"</td>\n            <td>42\"</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">44 (XL)</strong></td>\n            <td>46\" / 116 cm</td>\n            <td>43\" / 109 cm</td>\n            <td>19.0\"</td>\n            <td>26.0\"</td>\n            <td>43\"</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">46 (XXL)</strong></td>\n            <td>48\" / 121 cm</td>\n            <td>45\" / 114 cm</td>\n            <td>19.5\"</td>\n            <td>26.5\"</td>\n            <td>43\"</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- TAB 3: KIDS\' SIZING -->\n  <section id=\"tab-kids\" class=\"size-guide-tab-pane policy-section\">\n    <div class=\"policy-section-header\">\n      <span class=\"policy-section-tag\">Kids\' Festive Collection</span>\n      <h2 class=\"policy-section-title\">Kids\' Festive &amp; Occasion Wear</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-subtitle\">Comfortable, soft-lined festive ensembles for boys and girls. If your child is between sizes, we recommend sizing up to accommodate natural growth.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"policy-table-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"luxury-size-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Age Group</th>\n            <th>Standard Size</th>\n            <th>Chest (in / cm)</th>\n            <th>Child\'s Height (cm)</th>\n            <th>Kurta / Top Length (in)</th>\n            <th>Bottom Length (in)</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">2 - 3 Years</strong></td>\n            <td>20 / 22</td>\n            <td>22\" / 56 cm</td>\n            <td>85 - 95 cm</td>\n            <td>18\"</td>\n            <td>20\"</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">4 - 5 Years</strong></td>\n            <td>24</td>\n            <td>24\" / 61 cm</td>\n            <td>100 - 110 cm</td>\n            <td>22\"</td>\n            <td>24\"</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">6 - 7 Years</strong></td>\n            <td>26 / 28</td>\n            <td>26\" / 66 cm</td>\n            <td>115 - 125 cm</td>\n            <td>25\"</td>\n            <td>27\"</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">8 - 9 Years</strong></td>\n            <td>30</td>\n            <td>28\" / 71 cm</td>\n            <td>128 - 138 cm</td>\n            <td>28\"</td>\n            <td>31\"</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">10 - 11 Years</strong></td>\n            <td>32</td>\n            <td>30\" / 76 cm</td>\n            <td>140 - 150 cm</td>\n            <td>31\"</td>\n            <td>34\"</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong class=\"size-code\">12 - 14 Years</strong></td>\n            <td>34</td>\n            <td>32\" / 81 cm</td>\n            <td>152 - 162 cm</td>\n            <td>34\"</td>\n            <td>37\"</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- HOW TO MEASURE SECTION -->\n  <section id=\"how-to-measure\" class=\"policy-section\">\n    <div class=\"policy-section-header\">\n      <span class=\"policy-section-tag\">Step-by-Step Instructions</span>\n      <h2 class=\"policy-section-title\">How to Take Your Measurements</h2>\n      <div class=\"gold-hairline-sm\"></div>\n      <p class=\"section-subtitle\">Use a flexible measuring tape while standing relaxed. Keep the tape comfortably snug—do not pull it tight.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"policy-grid-3\">\n      <div class=\"measure-card\">\n        <div class=\"measure-number\">01</div>\n        <h4 class=\"measure-title\">Bust / Chest</h4>\n        <p class=\"measure-desc\">Wrap the tape around the fullest part of your chest or bust, keeping the measuring tape parallel to the floor under your arms.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"measure-card\">\n        <div class=\"measure-number\">02</div>\n        <h4 class=\"measure-title\">Natural Waist</h4>\n        <p class=\"measure-desc\">Measure around your natural waistline (the narrowest part of your torso, typically 1 to 2 inches above the navel).</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"measure-card\">\n        <div class=\"measure-number\">03</div>\n        <h4 class=\"measure-title\">Hips</h4>\n        <p class=\"measure-desc\">Stand with your feet together and measure around the fullest curve of your hips and seat.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"measure-card\">\n        <div class=\"measure-number\">04</div>\n        <h4 class=\"measure-title\">Shoulder Width</h4>\n        <p class=\"measure-desc\">Measure across your back from the edge of one shoulder bone across the spine to the opposite shoulder edge.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"measure-card\">\n        <div class=\"measure-number\">05</div>\n        <h4 class=\"measure-title\">Garment Length</h4>\n        <p class=\"measure-desc\">For kurtas and suits, measure from the highest point of the shoulder down to your desired hemline (knee, calf, or ankle).</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"measure-card\">\n        <div class=\"measure-number\">06</div>\n        <h4 class=\"measure-title\">Sleeve Length</h4>\n        <p class=\"measure-desc\">Measure from the top edge of your shoulder joint down to your wrist bone or preferred sleeve end.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Lucknow Alterations Box -->\n    <div class=\"boutique-alteration-callout\">\n      <div class=\"callout-icon\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">straighten</span></div>\n      <div class=\"callout-content\">\n        <h4>Need Personal Styling or Custom Sizing Assistance?</h4>\n        <p>Unsure which size suits you best? Share your bust, waist, and height measurements with our Lucknow styling concierges on WhatsApp. We will recommend the exact right size or arrange a complimentary fit at our Hazratganj / Gomti Nagar boutiques.</p>\n        <a href=\"https://wa.me/919278340090?text=Hello%20The%20Fashion%20Frame,%20I%20need%20assistance%20with%20sizing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"callout-wa-btn\">\n          <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">chat</span> Ask Stylist on WhatsApp\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n','Size & Fit Guide','','publish','closed','closed','','size-guide','','','2026-09-22 00:38:52','2026-09-22 00:38:52','',0,'http://the-fashion-frame.local/size-guide/',0,'page','',0),(201,0,'2026-09-22 00:38:52','2026-09-22 00:38:52','<div class=\"policy-page-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"policy-hero-card\">\n    <div class=\"policy-badge\">\n      <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">security</span>\n      <span>Effective Date: September 2026</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"policy-lead\">\n      At <strong>The Fashion Frame</strong> (\"we,\" \"our,\" or \"us\"), we value your patronage and are dedicated to safeguarding your personal data and digital privacy. This Privacy Policy details how we collect, handle, safeguard, and disclose information when you visit our website <strong>thefashionframe.com</strong>, visit our Lucknow flagship boutiques, or purchase our readymade apparel collections.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"policy-section\">\n    <div class=\"policy-detail-card\">\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">1. Information We Collect</h3>\n      <p>We only collect personal information necessary to deliver exceptional couture and boutique services to you:</p>\n      <ul class=\"policy-list\">\n        <li><strong>Personal Identification Data:</strong> Full name, telephone/WhatsApp number, email address, shipping address, and billing address provided when creating an account, booking a fitting, or placing an order.</li>\n        <li><strong>Order &amp; Transaction Records:</strong> Details of apparel purchased, size preferences, order history, invoice amounts, and fulfillment milestones.</li>\n        <li><strong>Payment Details:</strong> All payment transactions (Credit/Debit cards, Net Banking, UPI, and digital wallets) are securely routed and processed via RBI-authorized, PCI-DSS compliant payment gateways (such as Razorpay). <em>The Fashion Frame never stores your full card numbers, CVVs, or UPI PINs on our servers.</em></li>\n        <li><strong>Technical &amp; Browsing Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, device information, and browsing activity collected automatically through standard cookies to optimize website speed, layout, and shopping bag persistence.</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">2. How We Utilize Your Information</h3>\n      <p>We utilize the collected information strictly for legitimate commercial purposes:</p>\n      <ul class=\"policy-list\">\n        <li>Processing, verifying, tailoring, packaging, and dispatching your garment orders.</li>\n        <li>Providing real-time order tracking and dispatch updates via SMS, WhatsApp, and email.</li>\n        <li>Managing size exchanges, returns, refunds, and boutique fitting appointments.</li>\n        <li>Sending seasonal collection previews, festive lookbooks, and exclusive private invitations (only with your prior consent, with one-click unsubscribe available at any time).</li>\n        <li>Preventing fraudulent transactions and ensuring network security.</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">3. Data Sharing &amp; Third-Party Partners</h3>\n      <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal data to third parties. We share information solely with trusted service partners under strict confidentiality agreements:</p>\n      <ul class=\"policy-list\">\n        <li><strong>Logistics &amp; Courier Providers:</strong> National courier networks (e.g., BlueDart, Delhivery, DTDC) receive your name, delivery address, and phone number solely for doorstep package transit and delivery coordination.</li>\n        <li><strong>Payment Gateways:</strong> Encrypted financial transactions processed directly through certified payment facilitators.</li>\n        <li><strong>Regulatory Authorities:</strong> We may disclose data if mandated by Indian law, legal subpoena, or governmental directive.</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">4. Cookies &amp; Browser Analytics</h3>\n      <p>Our website uses modern cookies to remember your shopping cart items, preserve your login session, and analyze page visit performance. You may disable cookies through your browser settings, though doing so may limit your ability to add items to your bag or complete checkout.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">5. Data Protection &amp; Security Standards</h3>\n      <p>We implement 256-bit SSL (Secure Sockets Layer) encryption across our entire website. All customer data is housed in secured cloud servers with continuous monitoring and restricted administrative access.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">6. Your Rights &amp; Data Choices</h3>\n      <p>Under Indian information technology and personal data protection regulations, you have the right to review, update, or request the deletion of your personal records. You may also opt out of promotional messages at any time by replying \"STOP\" on WhatsApp or clicking unsubscribe in our newsletters.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">7. Boutique Contact &amp; Grievance Officer</h3>\n      <p>For questions or requests regarding your personal data, please contact our designated Grievance Officer:</p>\n      <div class=\"contact-box-inner\">\n        <p><strong>The Fashion Frame Customer Care &amp; Privacy Office</strong></p>\n        <p>Hazratganj / Gomti Nagar, Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh 226001, India</p>\n        <p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:care@thefashionframe.com\">care@thefashionframe.com</a></p>\n        <p>Telephone / WhatsApp: <a href=\"tel:+919278340090\">+91 92783 40090</a></p>\n        <p>Hours: Monday through Saturday, 10:00 AM – 7:00 PM IST</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n','Privacy Policy','','inherit','closed','closed','','3-revision-v1','','','2026-09-22 00:38:52','2026-09-22 00:38:52','',3,'http://the-fashion-frame.local/?p=201',0,'revision','',0),(202,0,'2026-09-22 00:38:52','2026-09-22 00:38:52','<div class=\"policy-page-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"policy-hero-card\">\n    <div class=\"policy-badge\">\n      <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">gavel</span>\n      <span>Last Updated: September 2026</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"policy-lead\">\n      Welcome to <strong>The Fashion Frame</strong>. By accessing our website, browsing our collections, or purchasing our readymade apparel in-store or online, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following Terms and Conditions of Service. Please read them attentively.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"policy-section\">\n    <div class=\"policy-detail-card\">\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">1. General Overview &amp; Agreement</h3>\n      <p>This website is operated by The Fashion Frame, located in Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh, India. Throughout the site, the terms \"we\", \"us\", and \"our\" refer to The Fashion Frame. We offer this website, including all information, garments, tools, and services available from this site to you, conditioned upon your acceptance of all terms, conditions, policies, and notices stated here.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">2. Eligibility &amp; Online Store Rules</h3>\n      <p>By agreeing to these Terms of Service, you represent that you are at least the age of majority in your state or province of residence. You may not use our garments or digital platforms for any illegal, unauthorized, or trademark-infringing activities.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">3. Artisanal Accuracy &amp; Readymade Product Representation</h3>\n      <p>The Fashion Frame specializes in premier readymade ethnic, festive, and formal wear. We strive to display the colors, fabrics, and embroideries of our apparel with absolute fidelity. However:</p>\n      <ul class=\"policy-list\">\n        <li><strong>Color Calibration:</strong> Due to differences in monitor color calibration and studio lighting, actual fabric hues may exhibit minor variations.</li>\n        <li><strong>Artisanal Detailing:</strong> Many of our ensembles feature authentic Lucknowi Chikankari embroidery and handcrafted embellishments. Slight organic nuances in threadwork or weave are characteristic of authentic craftsmanship rather than defects.</li>\n        <li><strong>Availability:</strong> We reserve the right to limit the sales of our garments to any person or geographic region, or limit order quantities per patron.</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">4. Pricing, Currency &amp; Taxes</h3>\n      <p>All prices displayed on our website are stated in <strong>Indian Rupees (INR)</strong> and are inclusive of all applicable Goods and Services Tax (GST). Prices for our garments are subject to change without prior notice, but alterations will not affect orders already confirmed.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">5. Orders, Payment &amp; Order Confirmation</h3>\n      <p>Receipt of an electronic order confirmation does not signify our final acceptance of your order. We reserve the right to accept, limit, or decline your order for legitimate operational reasons (e.g., stock discrepancy, address non-serviceability, or payment authorization failure). In the event of an order cancellation initiated by us, a full refund is immediately credited to your original payment method.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">6. Shipping, Title &amp; Risk of Loss</h3>\n      <p>All purchases of physical garments from The Fashion Frame are made pursuant to a shipment contract. This means that risk of loss and title for such items pass to you upon our delivery to the courier partner. In case of in-transit damage or package tampering, please notify us within 24 hours of receipt with unboxing photographs so we can resolve it promptly.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">7. Returns, Exchanges &amp; Alteration Services</h3>\n      <p>Our return and exchange provisions are governed by our dedicated <a href=\"/shipping-returns/#returns\"><strong>Shipping &amp; Returns Policy</strong></a>. Custom altered pieces or garments tailored specifically to client measurements are non-returnable.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">8. Intellectual Property Rights</h3>\n      <p>All content on this site—including but not limited to brand emblems, photographs, lookbooks, product copy, styling architectures, logos, and graphics—is the exclusive intellectual property of The Fashion Frame and is protected by Indian and international copyright and trademark laws.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">9. Governing Law &amp; Exclusive Jurisdiction</h3>\n      <p>These Terms of Service and any separate agreements whereby we provide you services or apparel shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the substantive laws of <strong>India</strong>. Any disputes, claims, or proceedings arising hereunder shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts located in <strong>Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh, India</strong>.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">10. Modifications to Service &amp; Terms</h3>\n      <p>You can review the most current version of the Terms of Service at any time at this page. We reserve the right to update, modify, or replace any part of these Terms by posting updates to our website.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"policy-subheading\">11. Boutique Inquiries &amp; Legal Contact</h3>\n      <p>Questions about the Terms of Service should be directed to:</p>\n      <div class=\"contact-box-inner\">\n        <p><strong>The Fashion Frame Boutique Management</strong></p>\n        <p>Hazratganj / Gomti Nagar, Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh 226001</p>\n        <p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:care@thefashionframe.com\">care@thefashionframe.com</a></p>\n        <p>Phone: <a href=\"tel:+919278340090\">+91 92783 40090</a></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n','Terms of Service','','publish','closed','closed','','terms-of-service','','','2026-09-22 00:38:52','2026-09-22 00:38:52','',0,'http://the-fashion-frame.local/terms-of-service/',0,'page','',0),(203,0,'2026-09-22 00:38:52','2026-09-22 00:38:52','','Shipping & Delivery','','publish','closed','closed','','shipping-delivery','','','2026-09-22 00:38:52','2026-09-22 00:38:52','',0,'http://the-fashion-frame.local/shipping-delivery/',1,'nav_menu_item','',0),(204,0,'2026-09-22 00:38:52','2026-09-22 00:38:52','','Returns & Exchanges','','publish','closed','closed','